WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.599
InfinityGAN's generator has two modules.

00:00:02.679 --> 00:00:09.497
The structure synthesizer is a neural implicit
function: it takes a global latent for scene appearance,

00:00:09.577 --> 00:00:14.185
a local latent tensor for variation, and a
continuous coordinate grid,

00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:17.332
and outputs a structural latent for any region.

00:00:17.412 --> 00:00:23.225
Coordinates use sine-cosine horizontally to exploit
landscape self-similarity and a tanh

00:00:23.305 --> 00:00:26.038
vertically for the ground-to-sky gradient,

00:00:26.118 --> 00:00:29.521
so it can be queried infinitely far from the origin.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:35.481
The texture synthesizer is a fully-convolutional
StyleGAN2 with all zero-padding removed,

00:00:35.561 --> 00:00:40.035
turning the structural latent, global style, and
noise into a patch.

00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:44.589
With no padding, the same coordinate always yields
identical pixels,

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:48.473
so independent patches tile seamlessly at constant memory.

00:00:48.553 --> 00:00:52.357
Training combines adversarial, R1, path-length, diversity,

00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:55.170
and vertical-coordinate regression losses.
